<title>JAPAN: Sanko Gosei -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sanko Gosei -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.03		vs	   17.66</p>
<p> Operating	  259    million	  vs	  443    million</p>
<p> Current	    284    million	  vs	  458    million</p>
<p> Net		  111    million	  vs	  230    million</p>
<p> EPS		   16.73 yen	  vs	   37.34 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sanko Gosei Ltd is a major industrial plastic parts maker.</p>
